	(descr "M.2 module standoff: Sinhoo SMTSO2010CTJ (M2 x 0.4 thread, 1.00 +-0.13 mm high, flange 5.56, shank 3.60 x 1.53). Hole 3.73 and minimum solder pad 6.2 per the PEM SMTSO family table (YIYUAN SMTSO datasheet, M2 row). The 1.53 mm shank protrudes ~0.33 mm through a 1.2 mm board. Solder pad 6.2 on the standoff side only; 4.3 mm (0.29 mm ring) on the inner layers and the far side, which is under the CM5 module next to its JP3 connector.")
